    "text/html": "<html><body>\n<!--StartFragment--><article class=\"post\"><header class=\"post-header\"><h1 class=\"post-title\">How to build a raised bed</h1><p class=\"byline\">By <a href=\"https://www.example.org/authors/sam-rowe\" rel=\"author\">Sam Rowe</a> &middot; <time datetime=\"2026-03-14\">March 14, 2026</time></p></header><div class=\"post-body\"><p>A raised bed warms up <strong>earlier in spring</strong> and drains well. You need <em>untreated</em> lumber, screws and soil.</p><figure class=\"post-figure\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 width=%27800%27 height=%27450%27%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-src=\"/media/raised-bed.jpg\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 width=%27800%27 height=%27450%27%3E%3C/svg%3E 800w\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A finished raised bed\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"><figcaption>Raised beds along the south fence.</figcaption></figure><p><img src=\"https://images.example.net/garden/plot-7.jpg\" alt=\"Plot seven in June\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></p><h2 id=\"materials\">Materials<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"https://www.example.org/raised-bed#materials\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h2><p>See the <a href=\"https://www.example.org/guides/lumber\">lumber guide</a> and the <a href=\"#materials\">list below</a>. Read more: <a href=\"https://www.example.org/raised-bed?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email\">this page</a>.</p><aside class=\"related\"><h3>Related</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.example.org/compost\">Composting basics</a></li></ul></aside><div class=\"share-buttons\"><button type=\"button\" onclick=\"share()\">Share</button><button type=\"button\">Save</button></div></div></article><!--EndFragment-->\n</body>\n</html>",
